   "text": "A website prompt for a coach. Copy it and change the details:\n\n\"Leadership coach in Amsterdam. Minimal, confident, charcoal and white. Works with engineers who just became managers. Approach, packages with prices, testimonials, contact.\"\n\nWho and where, the mood, what's different, what to show. Write it in your own language: the copy follows it.\n\n📌 Save this for when you update your site.\n\nDescribe your business in plain language and get a free preview in about 30 seconds, no sign-up. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#coachingbusiness #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
